{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"734315500091342899","content":"\"Free.\"","created_at":"2020-07-22T03:25:04.548000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"735336588317425724","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"734315500091342899","content":"\"But I was not looked down on as I had thought. I ate a pidgeon that I had caught in the middle of the castle dining hall. Florian payed me no mind and even thought it was a little humorous.\"","created_at":"2020-07-22T03:26:07.511000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"735336852403257426","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Mistah Noodles","id":"363458590461132800","is_bot":0,"username":"mistahnoodles"},"author_id":"363458590461132800","channel_id":"734315500091342899","content":"Baeshra nods listening to the story. \"Is good. Is good. Free is best. You said you are you. Not...\" She pauses try to find the appropriate word before looking to Cato. \"What is it called when fleshling owns dog?\"","created_at":"2020-07-22T03:34:52.133000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"735339052827541596","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
