{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Mistah Noodles","id":"363458590461132800","is_bot":0,"username":"mistahnoodles"},"author_id":"363458590461132800","channel_id":"734315500091342899","content":"\"Pet\" Baeshra nods a couple times while repeating the word softly. \"Steel Claws is Steel Claws. Not pet. Be free. Do as Steel Claws likes. Not... Knights of Circles.\"","created_at":"2020-07-22T03:42:42.502000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"735341025698250772","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"734315500091342899","content":"\"The Knights do much good in the world, although I guess that isn't the point. Maybe I should talk to Florian and discuss our relationship in more detail.\"","created_at":"2020-07-22T03:46:05.289000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"735341876248576101","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"734315500091342899","content":"\"I appreciate our friendship Baeshra.\"","created_at":"2020-07-22T03:47:12.408000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"735342157765804214","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
