{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Mistah Noodles","id":"363458590461132800","is_bot":0,"username":"mistahnoodles"},"author_id":"363458590461132800","channel_id":"734315500091342899","content":"\"What does Steel Claws see?\"","created_at":"2020-07-22T03:56:23.310000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"735344468416528485","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"734315500091342899","content":"\"Eternity. It just goes on and, on forever. We are so small.\"","created_at":"2020-07-22T03:57:35.726000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"735344772151246931","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Mistah Noodles","id":"363458590461132800","is_bot":0,"username":"mistahnoodles"},"author_id":"363458590461132800","channel_id":"734315500091342899","content":"\"Small? We are big.\"","created_at":"2020-07-22T03:59:45.950000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"735345318350159883","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"734315500091342899","content":"\"What about you?\"","created_at":"2020-07-22T03:59:46.235000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"735345319545536512","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"734315500091342899","content":"\"Compared to a giant you are small. Or compared to a god very small. However compared to a mouse we are all big.\"","created_at":"2020-07-22T04:02:09.791000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"735345921663041557","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Mistah Noodles","id":"363458590461132800","is_bot":0,"username":"mistahnoodles"},"author_id":"363458590461132800","channel_id":"734315500091342899","content":"\"I see. Small dots. Bright dots. Called stars. Some stars in clustered families. Some stars connect, make consolations. Stories of heroes and monsters connect to them. That's what Baeshra sees.\"","created_at":"2020-07-22T04:07:52.990000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"735347361143849010","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Mistah Noodles","id":"363458590461132800","is_bot":0,"username":"mistahnoodles"},"author_id":"363458590461132800","channel_id":"734315500091342899","content":"\"True. Giants very big. But Web is god. Baeshra bigger than Web. Not all gods big. So not all giants big. And Skitter big too, not big like Baeshra, but not all mice small.\"","created_at":"2020-07-22T04:10:07.989000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"735347927370956801","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"734315500091342899","content":"\"Is web really a god?\"","created_at":"2020-07-22T04:10:56.224000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"735348129683210250","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Mistah Noodles","id":"363458590461132800","is_bot":0,"username":"mistahnoodles"},"author_id":"363458590461132800","channel_id":"734315500091342899","content":"\"Is Web not? Web answer spider prayers. Web talk to spiders, and spiders talk to Web. Web turn into... big spider. Web eats spider foods. Web is Spider god.\"","created_at":"2020-07-22T04:14:03.573000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"735348915481870416","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
